; A wall across the bottom of the gentle ramp. The whole point of the ramp is
; the speed it gives you, so this is the first thing in the project that spends
; that speed on ACCESS rather than on distance. break_speed 12 is above running
; pace (7.5) and below what the ramp delivers (~16).
[node name="RampWallA" parent="." instance=ExtResource("brk")]
